Title:
_Air Bud in the **RAW**_
Credit: Written By
Author: Michael Glaser-Garbrick
Rev: Rev. 2
Rev Date: Rev Date 2025-09-17
Draft Date: Initial Date 2025-08-27
Contact: Your mom's house

/*Thoughts**<

!ANNOUNCER
!PEOPLE COMMENTATING ON THE WHOLE THING
!SLAPPIN JACK - Showed up to his house while vacuuming and ripped it to shreds
!MAGIC MIKE - Took a shit in his locker
!BREAKING BRIAN - Barf in his corner before the fight
*/

INT. The wrestling ring


ANNOUNCER
Ladies and Gentlemen! Let's get ready to RUMBLLEEEEE!!!!! Tonight we have BREAKING BRIAN, a newcomer who is looking to make his mark on this world joining us for our P.A.W.S. Charity: – Providing Assistance for Wounded Shelter-dogs

Audience awws

ANNOUNCER (CONT'D)
BREAKING BRIAN, may I call you BRIAN?

BREAKING BRIAN
I'd prefer BREAKI-

ANNOUNCER
Alright. BRIAN are you nervous for your fight against, the legendary AIR BUD?

BREAKING BRIAN
You know I gotta say that I am kind of nervous STEVE

ANNOUNCER
I mean AIR BUD is a ferocious monster in and out of the square. Let's go to KEVIN to learn more about his victims

BREAKING BRIAN	
Victims?

KEVIN
Thank you STEVE, I'm here with SLAPPIN JACK, renowned for his powerful slaps heard around the world. Tell us SLAPPIN JACK, how did AIR BUD harm you?

SLAPPIN JACK
I'm shook KEVIN. I am absolutely rocked to my core. I was at home vacuuming, well I was trying to vacuum

KEVIN
Trying to vacuum? What do you mean?

SLAPPIN JACK	
Well you see KEVIN, I got my vacuum out and it had been ripped to shreds

KEVIN
Jesus!

SLAPPIN JACK
That's not all KEVIN, I looked around wondering who could do this and this golden retriever was flipping me off!

KEVIN
OH GOOD LORD!! 

SLAPPIN JACK	
It's terrible KEVIN, I can't sleep. I'm constantly on edge. He knows where. I. Live KEVIN. 

KEVIN
Get this man some bodyguards! ASAP!

SLAPPIN JACK
Thank you KEVIN, maybe one day I can find peace once more

KEVIN
Back to you STEVE

ANNOUNCER
Thank you KEVIN, so tell me BRIAN

BREAKING BRIAN	
It's BREAKI-

ANNOUNCER(cont'd)
How are you feeling BRIAN? Are you nervous yet?

BREAKING BRIAN	
I mean he is stalking other wrestlers. How couldn't I be nervous after that?

ANNOUNCER
Not now BRIAN, I'm currently receiving another transmission about something more interesting than you

BREAKING BRIAN	
(frustrated)
Fine then.

KEVIN
Thank you STEVE, I'm here with MAGIC MIKE, renowned for his ability to slip out of opponent's holds almost as if it were magic. Tell us MAGIC MIKE, how did AIR BUD harm you?

MAGIC MIKE
(quietly)
Shut up

KEVIN
Excuse me?

MAGIC MIKE
I said shut up! He took an actual shit in my locker before our match. There I said it. 

KEVIN
Jesus! That is disgusting

MAGIC MIKE	
Oh you thought that was it? He sent me a picture in the mail. It was a picture of him and my mom in bed, and on the back it just said your wife is next

KEVIN
OH GOOD LORD! I'm going to be sick!

MAGIC MIKE	
I just feel so violated by him! He just strikes where he knows you are weak

MAGIC MIKE runs away crying

KEVIN
Back to you STEVE

ANNOUNCER
Thank you KEVIN, so tell me BRIAN

BREAKING BRIAN	
It's BREAKI-

ANNOUNCER
How are you feeling about this? Are **you** nervous? Don't answer that. I'm getting a live update.

BREAKING BRIAN	
What the...

ANNOUNCER (CONT'D)
To you KEVIN

KEVIN
Thank you STEVE. I'm live here in the ring where there seems to be vomit in BRIAN's corner

ANNOUNCER	
JESUS!

KEVIN
You're telling me!

ANNOUNCER	
This is absolutely disgusting, I can smell it from here

BREAKING BRIAN	
Oh man I'm going to slip in the ring

KEVIN
THIS JUST IN! A toy that looks like BRIAN, head has been torn off!

ANNOUNCER	
OH GOOD LORD! The humanity!!

KEVIN
THANK YOU!

BREAKING BRIAN	
CAN I SAY SOMETHING! Can I just say something? You know what? You can vomit in my corner, but when you tear off a doll's head that roughly looks like me. Then it's personal. It's BREAKING BRIAN, and I am about  to show the world, why they call me that

BB storms to ring, and performs the ultimate back breaking move on Air Bud

Crowd boos

ANNOUNCER
(flat)
Dude. You're not serious are you?

BREAKING BRIAN	
What?

KEVIN
You just performed Rock Bottom, an ultimate move on a golden retriever. He needs to go to the hospital

BREAKING BRIAN	
But-

ANNOUNCER	
It's a charity event. You didn't honestly think that AIR BUD, a national icon, really did all of those things with malicious intent? He's a dog for christ's sakes. Who, I might remind you, is helping wounded shelter dogs

BREAKING BRIAN	
Can we just call it a charity mishap?
